# Pinned patched TiKV v8.5.8 release for test clusters (dulao5/tidb-rs#531).
# Built from dulao5/tikv branch rust-tidb/v8.5.8-stable-rpn-fn (fixes for #523/#524).
# Commit 8cc700315 adds only .github/workflows/release-patched-tikv.yml on top of the
# vendored query-crate commit a87863eb7 (TiKV Rust code is identical).
#
# Per-platform tarballs (tikv-server-<tag>-<os>-<arch>.tar.gz) and SHA-256 checksums are
# produced by .github/workflows/release-patched-tikv.yml in dulao5/tikv.
#
# When developing locally before a release asset is published, set:
#   TIDB_RS_TIKV_BIN=/path/to/tikv-server
# or:
#   TIDB_RS_TIKV_SRC=/path/to/dulao5-tikv-checkout
# tools/tikv-patched.sh still verifies that the binary reports the pinned version and commit.
